 ```
 
+### Collecting listener results
+
+`EventEmitter.emitCollect` synchronously invokes the listeners registered for
+an event and returns a new array containing each listener's return value in
+registration order. It forwards arguments and uses the same listener context
+as `emit`; promises are returned as-is and are not awaited.
+
+```js
+var results = EE.emitCollect('event-name', 'payload');
+// results contains the exact values returned by the listeners.
+```
+
 ### Tests and benchmarks
 
 To run tests run `npm test`. To run the benchmarks run `npm run benchmark`.
